@gjohansson-ST Hej! After reviewing your PR I don't think your suggested solution takes into consideration that there is also an issue with codes consisting of > 4 digits. 
My error reads:  "Call-service error. Code '123456' for locking lock.myYaleDoormanLock doesn't match pattern ^\d{4}$"

Verisure forces users to use 6 digit codes for Yale Doorman locks. A six digit code will not match the pattern above.
